<title>MEXICO: Two Pemex Gulf of Mexico ports still closed - Pemex.</title>
<headline>Two Pemex Gulf of Mexico ports still closed - Pemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf of Mexico Petroleos Mexicanos crude oil ports Pajaritos and Dos Bocas remained closed as of 1645 local/2145 GMT Wednesday, a spokeswoman from the state-owned oil company said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tuesday night the Veracruz and Tabasco state ports were closed in the face of strong wind gusts of up to 40 knots. Cayo Arcas, the third of Pemex's main exporting terminals, remains open for shipping.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903</p>
